<v Ira Glass>在我们的网站ThisAmericanLife.org，《This American Life》由PRX公共广播交易所交付给公共广播电台。

00:57:11.900 --> 00:57:18.390
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, what does he say about me quoting him here at the end of every show?
<v Ira Glass>像往常一样，感谢我们节目的联合创始人，托雷·马拉蒂亚先生。你知道，关于我在每期节目结束时引用他，他怎么说？

00:57:18.390 --> 00:57:24.840
<v Jeff Garlin>If he's not bored doing that every night, there's something wrong with him because I'd want to kill myself.
<v Jeff Garlin>如果他每晚做那个不觉得无聊，那他肯定有什么毛病，因为我要是那样我会想自杀。

00:57:24.840 --> 00:57:29.840
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《This American Life》的故事回来。
